# OpenAI speech-to-text, optional: the room's transcription settings can hold the
# key instead, and that is the recommended place. Keep any real value in
# .env.voice (ignored by Git). With no key anywhere, the room transcribes locally
# on CPU. The engine and model are chosen in the room, not here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Observability (OpenTelemetry). Optional, and off unless the endpoint is set.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the room forwards traces and metrics: the base URL of an OTLP/HTTP
# collector, without the /v1/... path. The room appends /v1/traces and
# /v1/metrics itself, and it is also where it relays the browser's own spans,
# so the page keeps talking only to the room.
# Unset, nothing is started, nothing is exported and the page never downloads
# the OpenTelemetry SDK: no endpoint costs nothing.
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://127.0.0.1:4318

# What the room calls itself in the collector. Default: sidevoice-room.
# OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=sidevoice-room
